 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Dark Claw — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you have learned new methods of enhancement. You gain two Claw options and one more option at 6th, 11th, and 18th level.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Brutal Claws</strong>. Your claws deal an additional damage dice.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Elemental Claws</strong>. You can choose to change the damage type of your claws to one of the following types: fire, cold, lightning, thunder, acid. You can change the type during a long rest.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Absorbing Claws</strong>. On a hit, you can spend 1 CE to deal an additional 1d6 necrotic damage. You regain hit points equal to the necrotic damage dealt.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Pure Claws</strong>. Your claws ignore resistances to damage.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Barbed Claws</strong>. Once per turn on a hit, you can spend 2 CE to force the target to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they are bleeding and take 1d6 slashing damage at the start of their turn until a creature uses their action to staunch the wound or they regain hit points.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
